 "remarks": "A rare renovation opportunity to completely remodel an entire apartment and let your creative genius run wild. This is not a turnkey property but the right person can level up and completely transform this 900 sq ft 2 BR, 1 BTH unit into the something spectacular and into the future well beyond 2026 -- Unit 417 is a total end unit with direct afternoon sunlight and a flexible layout featuring a well proportioned living room, a future dream kitchen and a surprisingly large dining area, two large freshly painted bedrooms and all the potential in the world with the possibilities being endless. River Haven is an owner-centric co-op residence, uniquely positioned in a residential neighborhood offering accessible and affordable entry into one of Stamford's most competitive housing markets. Between Scalzi and Mill River Parks, Cloonan and Hart Magnet Elementary public schools with Ridgeway Shopping Center just moments away and downtown Stamford at your fingertips. Enjoy the convenience of a prime, amenity rich location close to restaurants, entertainment, shops, schools, parks, and public transportation. This is an estate sale offered in as is condition, no disclosures given, owner occupancy only, no investors. Board requires a maximum 34 debt to income ratio. Taxes incl. in HOA.",
